  <div class="chunk" data-kind="about">


<div class="flex">
  <div>
    <h1 name="about" style="color: #185661"> Join me in the fight to achieve liberty and justice for all </h1>
    <p style="display: inline;">
<p dir="ltr"><span id="docs-internal-guid-3c81430f-c7d2-874e-f5e7-50ae3ba29816"><strong>Anthony Clark is a military veteran, special education high school teacher and founder of the Suburban Unity Alliance.</strong> He believes it&rsquo;s time this country lives up to its promise of liberty and justice for all. Anthony is here to work with you in the fight for medicare for all, criminal justice reform, public education reform and responsible job creation.<br></span>    </p>

  </div>

<!--
  <div class="about-flex">
    <div style="height: 10%;">
<p>Let&#39;s reach $50k in donations by January 1st, 2018.</p>    </div>
          
  </div>
 -->

</div>
  </div>
  <div class="chunk" data-kind="quote">

<div class="flex">
  <div style="
    width: 66%; min-height: 50vh;
    background-image: url(https://cosmic-s3.imgix.net/3d097700-cb42-11e7-89de-3b786c17b959-AClark_750x277.jpg);
    margin-right: 10px; background-size: cover; background-position: center;">
  </div>
  <div class="full-center" style="
    background-color: #185661; margin-left: 10px; color: white;
    width: 40%; font-weight: bold; font-family: 'Roboto Condensed'; padding: 20px;
    font-size: 30px;
  ">
“In order to truly make a difference in this world, we have to change things on a systemic level.  We can’t keep being reactive.”  </div>
</div>
  </div>
  <div class="chunk" data-kind="issues">
<h1 style="color: #185661"> In the wealthiest nation in the world, we should all have the things we need to thrive.</h1>
<p style="display: inline;">
<p dir="ltr">The political establishment have monopolized our wealth and power for long enough. The American people are ready for a new movement that creates systemic change. We can&#39;t expect establishment politicians like Danny Davis, who benefit from maintaining the status quo, to treat root causes, and fight for people. I am part of a national movement to create a democracy that works for all of us.&nbsp;</p>

<a href="/platform" class="more-about" style="color: #bb4646; ">
  Read My Full Platform Here
</a>
  </div>
