  <div class="chunk" data-kind="why">
<div name="why" class="banner-header" style="background-color: #185661;">
  <h1 style="color: white;"> Why Support Anthony </h1>
</div>
<!-- <div class="flex" style="padding-top: 20px; text-align: left;"> -->
<div style="padding-top: 20px; overflow: hidden; text-align: left;">
  <h1 style="color: #185661"> Justice, Jobs, and Education</h1>
    <img
      src="https://cosmic-s3.imgix.net/64cbec30-cb44-11e7-89de-3b786c17b959-IMG_6293.JPG"
      style="max-height: 300px; float: right; max-width: 40%; max-height: 100%; margin: 10px;" hspace="5"
    />
  <p>Raised in Oak Park, Illinois, to a working class family, Anthony Clark is a military veteran, high school special education teacher and active community organizer. In the summer of 2016, Anthony founded the Suburban Unity Alliance, an organization dedicated to combating discrimination by raising awareness and bringing communities together based on common interests and community goals. He believes it&rsquo;s time this country lives up to its promise of liberty and justice for all.<br><br>Anthony is here to work with you in the fight for medicare for all, criminal justice reform, public education reform and responsible job creation. As your congressman representing Illinois&rsquo; 7th district, he will be your voice in Washington that insists healthcare is a human right and will work to fulfill your hope for a better future.<br><br>As Anthony&#39;s grandfather Choom often quoted from Muhammad Ali, &quot;Service to others is the rent you pay for room here on earth.&quot; and Anthony believes it&#39;s time to rent to own.</p>
</div>
  <!-- <div style="padding-right: 30px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 20px; width: 100%;">
  </div> -->
  </div>
  <div class="chunk" data-kind="volunteer">
